ceremony|Formal/traditional occasion not necessarily celebration or religion. Welcome timing and organiser translate faithfully; countable noun supports solemn occasions too.
exclude|Leaving a cost outside a total and barring participation are distinct supported boundaries. Delivery-price and age-rule examples preserve scope without asserting a real policy; from valency checked.
leash|Animal restraint strap/cord definition includes non-chain forms. Shortened dog lead and crossing context match Vietnamese; on relation is idiomatic and not a literal surface.
proximity|Nearness broad across spatial/time/relationship contexts, with spatial example selected. Vietnamese natural rephrasing retains station convenience without adding a distance measure.
thunder|Sound related to lightning rather than lightning itself. Interrupted conversation and singular clap align; countability note avoids using a thunder for one noise and makes no weather prediction.
